---
layout: base.njk
title: "Join Us"
description: "Become a member of the Kiwanis Club of Winchester, Virginia. Join our community of volunteers making a difference."
canonical: /join/
navActive: join
---

  <div class="page-hero" style="--page-hero-image:url('{{ cms.join.hero.image }}'); --page-hero-position:{{ cms.join.hero.position }};">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">Join Us</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>{{ cms.join.hero.title }}</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">{{ cms.join.hero.subtitle | markdownInline | safe }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── WHY JOIN ── -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="text-center reveal" style="margin-bottom:56px;">
        <span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:0 auto 12px; display:inline-flex;">Why Kiwanis?</span>
        <h2 id="why-heading" class="section-title">{{ cms.join.why.title }}</h2>
        <p class="section-body" style="margin:0 auto;">{{ cms.join.why.intro | markdownInline | safe }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="benefit-card reveal">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:10px;">Make a Real Impact</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">Every program we run directly benefits children and families in Winchester. Your time and effort create lasting change in your own backyard.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:10px;">Build Real Friendships</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">Weekly meetings and events create the kind of friendships that last for years. Kiwanis members often describe the club as a second family.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card reveal reveal-d2">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:10px;">Develop as a Leader</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">Kiwanis offers leadership opportunities at every level — from running a single event to holding elected club office and participating in district programs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card reveal reveal-d3">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:10px;">Join a Global Network</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">You'll be part of Kiwanis International — a network of volunteers in 80+ countries, all united by the same commitment to improving the world for children.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── EMOTIONAL IMAGE BREAK ── -->
  <section style="padding:0 0 80px;" aria-label="Kids and community">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="reveal" style="position:relative; border-radius:24px; overflow:hidden; aspect-ratio:21/9; box-shadow:0 32px 80px rgba(0,26,92,0.18);">
        <img src="{{ cms.join.feature.image }}"
             alt="{{ cms.join.feature.imageAlt }}"
             class="img-cover"
             loading="lazy">
        <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,26,92,0.72) 0%, rgba(0,26,92,0.2) 60%, transparent 100%);"></div>
        <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:48px;">
          <div style="max-width:480px;">
            <p style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.2rem); font-weight:800; color:white; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:16px;">
              {{ cms.join.feature.headline }}
            </p>
            <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:24px;">
              {{ cms.join.feature.body | markdownInline | safe }}
            </p>
            <a href="mailto:pres@winvakiw.org?subject=Joining%20Kiwanis" class="btn btn-gold">Join the Club</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── HOW IT WORKS ── -->
  <section class="section bg-light" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="text-center reveal" style="margin-bottom:56px;">
        <span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:0 auto 12px; display:inline-flex;">Simple Process</span>
        <h2 id="how-heading" class="section-title">How to Get Started</h2>
        <p class="section-body" style="margin:0 auto;">Joining Kiwanis is straightforward. No complicated application — just reach out and we'll take it from there.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="reveal text-center">
          <div style="width:56px; height:56px; background:var(--kw-blue); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 20px; color:white; font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:800; font-size:1.2rem;">1</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Send Us an Email</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65; margin-bottom:16px;">Email our club president at <strong>pres@winvakiw.org</strong> to express your interest. A member will reach out to answer any questions and help get you started.</p>
          <a href="mailto:pres@winvakiw.org" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">pres@winvakiw.org</a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal reveal-d1 text-center">
          <div style="width:56px; height:56px; background:var(--kw-blue); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 20px; color:white; font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:800; font-size:1.2rem;">2</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Visit a Meeting</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">Come as a guest to one of our Wednesday noon meetings at the Winchester Moose Club (215 E. Cork St.). No commitment required — just show up and see what we're about.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal reveal-d2 text-center">
          <div style="width:56px; height:56px; background:var(--kw-gold); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 20px; color:var(--kw-navy); font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:800; font-size:1.2rem;">3</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Join the Club</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">When you're ready, formally join as a Kiwanis member. You'll gain full access to all programs, events, and the broader Kiwanis International community.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── MEMBER RESOURCES ── -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="member-resources-heading">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin-bottom:16px; display:inline-flex;">Member Path</span>
          <h2 id="member-resources-heading" class="section-title">Application, Dues &amp; Member Documents</h2>
          <div class="divider-gold"></div>
          <p style="color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:18px;">
            The club is preparing a clearer online home for membership materials. For now, membership applications, dues instructions, committee documents, and member-only resources are handled directly through club leadership.
          </p>
          <p style="color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:28px;">
            Prospective members should email the club president or visit a Wednesday meeting. Existing members can use the resources page for newsletters, document guidance, and contact points.
          </p>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <a href="/resources/#member-resources" class="btn btn-primary">Member Resources</a>
            <a href="mailto:pres@winvakiw.org?subject=Membership%20Application" class="btn btn-outline-blue">Ask About Joining</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-d2" style="background:var(--kw-light); border-radius:var(--radius-card); padding:32px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:18px;">Current online status</h3>
          <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;">
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;">
              <span class="tag tag-blue" style="flex-shrink:0;">Live</span>
              <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.6;">Newsletter archive and public club information.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;">
              <span class="tag tag-gold" style="flex-shrink:0;">By request</span>
              <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.6;">Membership application, dues details, and internal documents.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;">
              <span class="tag tag-navy" style="flex-shrink:0;">Future</span>
              <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.6;">Printable brochure, online application, and payment tools can be added after approval.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── MEETING INFO ── -->
  <section class="section bg-light" aria-labelledby="meeting-heading">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin-bottom:16px; display:inline-flex;">Every Week</span>
          <h2 id="meeting-heading" class="section-title">Where We Meet</h2>
          <div class="divider-gold"></div>
          <p style="color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:32px;">
            The Kiwanis Club of Winchester meets every Wednesday at noon. Our meetings are a mix of community updates, program planning, and the kind of good conversation that comes from spending time with people who share your values. Guests are always welcome — no prior notice required.
          </p>

          <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px;">
            <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start;">
              <div style="width:44px; height:44px; background:var(--kw-blue-light); border-radius:11px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; color:var(--kw-blue);">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; color:var(--kw-dark); margin-bottom:3px;">When</p>
                <p style="color:var(--kw-muted);">Every Wednesday at noon</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start;">
              <div style="width:44px; height:44px; background:var(--kw-blue-light); border-radius:11px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; color:var(--kw-blue);">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; color:var(--kw-dark); margin-bottom:3px;">Where</p>
                <p style="color:var(--kw-muted);">Winchester Moose Club<br>215 E. Cork St., Winchester, VA 22601</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start;">
              <div style="width:44px; height:44px; background:var(--kw-blue-light); border-radius:11px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; color:var(--kw-blue);">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; color:var(--kw-dark); margin-bottom:3px;">Contact</p>
                <a href="mailto:pres@winvakiw.org" style="color:var(--kw-blue); font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">pres@winvakiw.org</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Card -->
        <div class="reveal reveal-d2">
          <div style="background:var(--kw-navy); border-radius:24px; padding:48px 40px; color:white; text-align:center;">
            <div style="width:70px; height:70px; background:rgba(255,209,0,0.15); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 24px; color:var(--kw-gold);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="color:white; font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:14px;">Ready to Join?</h3>
            <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72); font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:28px;">
              Email us and a Kiwanis member will get back to you promptly, answer your questions, and make your first visit enjoyable.
            </p>
            <a href="mailto:pres@winvakiw.org" class="btn btn-gold" style="width:100%; margin-bottom:14px; justify-content:center;">
              Email pres@winvakiw.org
            </a>
            <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45); font-size:0.8rem;">We typically respond within 24–48 hours</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── FAQ ── -->
  <section class="section bg-light" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="text-center reveal" style="margin-bottom:48px;">
        <span class="tag tag-blue" style="margin:0 auto 12px; display:inline-flex;">Questions</span>
        <h2 id="faq-heading" class="section-title">Common Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;">
        <div class="reveal" style="background:white; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--kw-border); padding:24px 28px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:10px;">Do I need any special skills or background to join?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">No. Kiwanis welcomes anyone who wants to serve their community. Whether you have decades of experience or have never volunteered before, there's a role for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-d1" style="background:white; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--kw-border); padding:24px 28px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:10px;">How much time do I need to commit?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">Weekly Wednesday noon meetings are about an hour. Service projects vary — some are a few hours, others are longer events like Pancake Day. You participate at whatever level works for your schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-d2" style="background:white; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--kw-border); padding:24px 28px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:10px;">Can I attend a meeting before committing?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">Absolutely — guests are always welcome. Come have lunch with us on any Wednesday at noon. No RSVP needed, no pressure to join.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-d3" style="background:white; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--kw-border); padding:24px 28px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:10px;">Is there a membership fee?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--kw-muted); line-height:1.65;">Yes, there are annual dues. Contact us at <a href="mailto:pres@winvakiw.org" style="color:var(--kw-blue); font-weight:600;">pres@winvakiw.org</a> for current membership fee information.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
